1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:10,647
Speaking, task two. Card number 21. You are at a language school. You want to register for a Czech exam. Ask four questions.

2
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:15,547
You are at a language school. You want to register for a Czech exam.

3
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:18,984
Good afternoon. What can I do for you?

4
00:00:24,633 --> 00:00:27,452
Hello, when is the next exam date?

5
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,688
The next date is the 15th of November.

6
00:00:36,333 --> 00:00:37,533
How much is it?

7
00:00:38,067 --> 00:00:40,233
The exam costs 3,200 crowns.

8
00:00:45,867 --> 00:00:47,249
Where will the exam be?

9
00:00:47,800 --> 00:00:49,940
The exam will be here at our school.

10
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:57,087
What should I bring?

11
00:00:57,633 --> 00:00:59,616
Bring your passport and a blue pen.

12
00:01:00,267 --> 00:01:03,373
Thank you for the information. Goodbye.

13
00:01:04,033 --> 00:01:05,285
Good luck.

14
00:01:05,933 --> 00:01:15,022
Practise card 21 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe to the channel — there's a new video every day.
